# When to Use BFS

Use BFS when the goal is to find:

- Minimum distance
- Minimum steps
- Minimum time
- Nearest node/cell
- Level order traversal
- Spread simulations

### Keywords

```text
Shortest
Nearest
Minimum Steps
Minimum Distance
Minute by Minute
Spread
Infection
Fire
Level Order
```

### Examples

- 994. Rotting Oranges
- 542. 01 Matrix
- 102. Binary Tree Level Order Traversal
- 127. Word Ladder

